Third-party attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two parts of this plugin are derived from the open-source project:

    eisgroup/kraken-rules — https://github.com/eisgroup/kraken-rules
    Copyright EIS Group and contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

1. The grammar (src/main/bnf/Kraken.bnf) and the structure of the KEL
   expression parser, derived from the ANTLR grammars KrakenDSL.g4,
   Common.g4 and Value.g4.

2. The built-in function catalogue
   (src/main/resources/functions/kel-functions.json), generated by
   tools/gen_functions.py from the @ExpressionFunction,
   @FunctionDocumentation, @ParameterDocumentation, @ParameterType and
   @ReturnType annotations of kraken-expression-language. It reproduces the
   names, signatures, descriptions and examples of the engine's native
   functions so the plugin can offer completion and documentation for them
   without executing or linking against the engine.

